t←valueType val
⍝ Return logical duckdb_type id for duckdb_value.
:If val=0
    t←type.INVALID
    →0
:EndIf
lt←api.duckdb_get_value_type val
:If lt=0
    t←type.INVALID
    →0
:EndIf
t←api.duckdb_get_type_id lt
⍝ duckdb_get_value_type returns a borrowed logical type:
⍝ valid only while value lives, and must not be destroyed.

